message: "If you use or build on ECONOVA-S™, please cite this repository."
title: "ECONOVA-S: An FT50- and AJG/ABS 4*/4-Grounded Dual-Core Architecture for Autonomous Scientific Discovery in AI, Data Economy, Finance, and Sustainable Welfare"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Homayoun"
    given-names: "Saeid"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2536-0446"
version: "2.5"
date-released: "2026-09-14"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Saehon/Saeid-Homayoun"
abstract: >-
  ECONOVA-S is a dual-core scientific economic intelligence architecture grounded in a systematic, relevance-gated synthesis of current FT50 and AJG/ABS 4*/4 research. It separates a Stable Economic Knowledge Core from a Replaceable Technology Core and integrates systems thinking, causal DAG governance, behavioral experimentation, econometric identification, multi-agent hypothesis generation, ERA-style empirical conversion, AlphaEvolve-inspired evolutionary search, AlphaFold-inspired latent-structure reasoning, independent replication, adversarial review, reproducibility, welfare interpretation, and explicit human approval before scientific-discovery claims.
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - economics
  - finance
  - data economy
  - scientific discovery
  - multi-agent systems
  - econometrics
  - sustainability
  - welfare
